{"id": "1733225", "name": "אינטגרל משולש בין פרבולואיד לחרוט ושני מישורים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>נגדיר תחום תלת מימדי \\(T\\) להיות התחום החסום בין הפרבולואיד&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</p><p></p><p>לבין החרוט&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</p><p>לבין המישורים</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(z={{CT:2}},\\quad z={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p>ונגדיר פונקציה</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">. \\(f(x,y,z)={{CT:4}}\\)</p><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;\\(\\iiint_Tf(x,y,z)\\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y\\mathbf{d}z= \\iiint_T{{CT:4}}\\; \\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y\\mathbf{d}z\\).&nbsp;</p><p>נבצע החלפת משתנים לקורדינאטות גליליות.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(x=r\\cos(\\theta),&nbsp;\\quad y=r\\sin(\\theta), \\quad z=z\\)</p><p>ונקבל את התחום המוגדר בעזרת</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\"><span>\\(g_1(z)\\leq r \\leq g_1(z), \\quad 0\\leq \\theta \\leq 2\\pi,\\quad {{CT:2}}\\leq z\\leq {{CT:3}}\\)<br></span></p><p style=\"direction: rtl;\">כאשר (המספרים \\(g_1(z),g_2(z)\\) פונקציות של \\(z\\)):</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(g_1(z)=\\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(g_2(z)=\\)&nbsp;[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p><br>ונקבל כי&nbsp;<p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">\\(\\iiint_T {{CT:4}}\\; \\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y\\mathbf{d}z=\\iiint_Tf(x,y,z)\\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y\\mathbf{d}z=\\)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\">\\(=\\int_0^{2\\pi }\\int_{{{CT:2}}}^{{{CT:3}}}\\int_{g_1(z)}^{g_2(z)}(f(r\\cos(\\theta),r\\sin(\\theta), z))\\cdot r\\;\\mathbf{d}r\\mathbf{d}z \\mathbf{d}\\theta=\\)[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</p><p>איור סכמטי של התחום \\(T\\) הוא (כאשר האדום הוא החרוט הצהוב הוא הפרבולואיד והתכלת הוא אחד המישורים).</p><p><img src=\"data/1733225/files/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"400\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\"><br></p><p><br></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "g1", "tans": "ans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "g2", "tans": "ans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, 